<p><a href="curve-comparison.html">← Cabinet design comparison</a></p><h1>Elliptical stile · dovetail V2</h1><p>The left V1 stile split into two pieces, with the same sliding dovetail as the rail. Rotate the assembled template 180° to make the opposite stile.</p>
<p><a class="download" href="models/NAME-bambu.3mf" download>Bambu project · current 12.75 mm thickness</a></p><p class="small">Saved with your current print settings, rotated sideways to clear the front purge line. The CAD preview below shows the original 19.05 mm thickness.</p><p><a href="models/NAME-plate.3mf" download>Model-only 3MF · 19.05 mm thick, arranged sideways</a> <a href="models/NAME.3mf" download>Assembled 3MF</a></p>
