<table><tr><td>Dovetail head / neck</td><td>38.1 / 25.4 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Engagement / mating clearance</td><td>19.05 / 0.2 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Piece lengths including connector</td><td>PARTSIZE mm</td></tr><tr><td>Width / thickness</td><td>57.15 / 19.05 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Honeycomb webs / solid center band</td><td>10 / 88.9 mm</td></tr></table>
<p>Print flat at 100%. The cut is 9.525 mm away from the midpoint to keep both pieces under the P1S plate’s 256 mm length. The joint remains inside the solid center band. Slide together through the thickness and align the routing edges.</p>
<p class="small">CAD and meshes checked; physical fit untested. The narrow plate margin may require checking brim clearance in your slicer.</p><p><a href="models/NAME-tongue.step">Tongue STEP</a> · <a href="models/NAME-socket.step">Socket STEP</a> · <a href="models/NAME-tongue.stl">Tongue STL</a> · <a href="models/NAME-socket.stl">Socket STL</a></p>
